                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Welcome to ART, an Assortment Recommendation Tool designed to help Vendors optimize and maximize their assortment on our platform f. This tool aims to provide valuable insights and streamline various tasks related to analyzing and improving assortment and overall sales performance across vertical segments, countries, and vendors. It caters to the needs of central commercial team members, regional commercial team members, country assortment PICs, account managers, and local sales team members. Let&apos;s dive into the features and functionalities of the dashboard tool.</run>
