                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>- Proportion of Vendors with significant portion of Top Selling SKUs: Users can measure the proportion of vendors whose assortment contains a significant portion of the top-selling SKUs. This metric helps identify vendors who have a good number of their products contributing to sales, enabling focused collaboration and improvement efforts.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>- Easy Addition of Vendor-Selected SKUs : The dashboard tool simplifies the process of adding vendor-selected SKUs to their catalog. Vendors can easily input their desired products, helping them expand their assortment and respond to market demands promptly. An integration with LS3 is planned.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
